57	          <Badge tone="green">Connected{kind === "token" ? " (API token)" : ""}</Badge>
58	        ) : (
59	          <Badge tone="slate">Not connected</Badge>
60	        )}
61	      </div>
62	
63	      <p className="mb-4 text-sm text-slate-400">
64	        Connect the Cloudflare account that holds your domains and we can set DNS up for you: mail
65	        records for Business Email, pointing a website at its server, and moving your domains after a
66	        migration. We only ask to {scopeSummary}, and we only ever touch the records you ask us to —
67	        we never read your traffic, change your settings, or delete anything else. DNS changes can
68	        take a few minutes to reach everyone.
